    "text": "Number&nbsp;of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>CO</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>NO</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math>.<br /><br />According to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>MOT</mi></math>,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>CO</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mn>1</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mo>*</mo></mover><mn>1</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mo>*</mo></mover><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn><msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn><msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn><msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></msup></math><br /><br />no unpaired e<sup>-</sup> so diamagnetic<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <msub> <mi>B</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mo>:</mo><mo